#sortorder:1
#showas:扭曲之敌
A more specialist scenario. Mainly you and one AI, and it's set to difficulty 7.

This is on the "classic" map type, with 80 planets. Full Ensemble AI type.  Your starting fleet is set to "Classic," which has the most basic available options.

The main component of this one is the "Scourge", a new AI creation of collected and absorbed races, mutilated into hideous forms for each one, which functions very differently from the main AI.

The Scourge and the AI will be working together against you.